s223:Domain-ConveyanceSystems
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-ConveyanceSystems ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that moves people or things within a building. Example `Domain-ConveyanceSystems` equipment include `Elevator` and `Escalator`." ;
  rdfs:label "Conveyance systems domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Electrical
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Electrical ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that distributes and monitors electrical power within a building. Example `Domain-Electrical` equipment include `ElectricityBreaker`, `ElectricEnergyConverter`, and `ElectricityMeter`." ;
  rdfs:label "Electrical domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-FireProtection
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-FireProtection ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that detect and mitigate the spread of fire within a building. Example `Domain-FireProtection` equipment include smoke detectors, alarms, and emergency public address systems." ;
  rdfs:label "Fire protection domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-HVAC
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-HVAC ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that condition and ventilate spaces within a building. Example `Domain-HVAC` equipment include `Fan`, `Pump`, and `AirHandlingUnit`." ;
  rdfs:label "HVAC domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Lighting
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Lighting ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that illuminate and manage the distribution of light within or outside of a building. Example `Domain-Lighting` equipment include `Luminaire`, `LightSensor`, and `WindowShade`." ;
  rdfs:label "Lighting domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Networking
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Networking ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that distributes and manages the flow of communication signals within a building. Example `Domain-Networking` equipment include `EthernetSwitch` and `PowerOverEthernetSwitch`" ;
  rdfs:label "Networking domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Occupancy
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Occupancy ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that determine whether and how many people are moving or present within a building. Example `Domain-Occupancy` equipment include `OccupantMotionSensor`, `OccupantPresenceSensor` and `OccupantCountSensor`" ;
  rdfs:label "Occupancy domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-PhysicalSecurity
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-PhysicalSecurity ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that control and monitor physical access to spaces within or outside of a building. Example `Domain-PhysicalSecurity` equipment include cameras, keycard sensors, and biometric scanners." ;
  rdfs:label "Physical security domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Plumbing
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Plumbing ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that distributes, holds, removes and monitors water within or outside of a building. Example `Domain-Plumbing` equipment include `Faucet`, `Sink`, and `FlushToilet`." ;
  rdfs:label "Plumbing domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
s223:Domain-Refrigeration
  a s223:Class ;
  a s223:Domain-Refrigeration ;
  a sh:NodeShape ;
  rdfs:comment "The domain that represents equipment that maintain internal temperatures below the surrounding ambient temperature with a building. Example `Domain-Refrigeration` equipment include `Refrigerator` and `Freezer`" ;
  rdfs:label "Refrigeration domain" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf s223:EnumerationKind-Domain ;
.
